            "id": "210100001",
            "speakerId": 1611,
            "speakerName": "丹迪",
            "text": "唔…我要好好想想…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210100002"
            ]
          },
          "210100002": {
            "id": "210100002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210100003"
            ]
          },
          "210100003": {
            "id": "210100003",
            "speakerId": 1611,
            "speakerName": "丹迪",
            "text": "啊，倒也没事，这家望舒客栈很高，我在想，往下爬完全部楼梯需要多长时间。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210100004"
